       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEXT-NATIVE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC X(3) VALUE 'ABC'.
       01 PADDED PIC X(6) VALUE 'ABC'.
       01 LONG-TEXT PIC X(8).
       01 RIGHT-TEXT PIC X(5) JUSTIFIED RIGHT.
       01 LETTERS PIC A(5).
       01 NEGATIVE-NUM PIC S9(4) VALUE -3.
       01 ZERO-NUM PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 POSITIVE-NUM PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF A NOT = PADDED DISPLAY 'BAD PADDING' END-IF
           IF NOT NEGATIVE-NUM IS NEGATIVE
             DISPLAY 'BAD NEGATIVE'
           END-IF
           IF ZERO-NUM IS NOT ZERO OR POSITIVE-NUM IS NOT POSITIVE
             DISPLAY 'BAD SIGN'
           END-IF
           MOVE ALL 'AB' TO LONG-TEXT RIGHT-TEXT LETTERS
           IF LONG-TEXT NOT = ALL 'AB' OR RIGHT-TEXT NOT = 'ABABA'
             DISPLAY 'BAD ALL'
           END-IF
           IF LETTERS NOT = 'ABABA' DISPLAY 'BAD LETTERS' END-IF
           MOVE SPACES TO LONG-TEXT
           IF LONG-TEXT NOT = SPACES DISPLAY 'BAD SPACES' END-IF
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO LONG-TEXT
           IF LONG-TEXT NOT = HIGH-VALUES DISPLAY 'BAD HIGH' END-IF
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO LONG-TEXT
           IF LONG-TEXT NOT = LOW-VALUES DISPLAY 'BAD LOW' END-IF
           MOVE QUOTES TO LONG-TEXT
           IF LONG-TEXT NOT = QUOTES DISPLAY 'BAD QUOTE' END-IF
           MOVE ZEROES TO LONG-TEXT
           IF LONG-TEXT NOT = ALL '0' DISPLAY 'BAD ZERO' END-IF
           IF 'A' = 'B' DISPLAY 'EQ' ELSE DISPLAY 'NE' END-IF
           IF 'A' < 'B' DISPLAY 'LT' ELSE DISPLAY 'NOT LT' END-IF
           IF 'A' <= 'B' DISPLAY 'LE' ELSE DISPLAY 'NOT LE' END-IF
           IF 'A' > 'B' DISPLAY 'GT' ELSE DISPLAY 'NOT GT' END-IF
           IF 'A' >= 'B' DISPLAY 'GE' ELSE DISPLAY 'NOT GE' END-IF
           IF 'AZ' < 'BA' DISPLAY 'PREFIX LT'
             ELSE DISPLAY 'PREFIX NOT LT' END-IF
           DISPLAY 'DONE'
           STOP RUN.
